WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Projenk turns synthetic CSV orders into an automated business report.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Explore monthly revenue, channels, category performance and business observations.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
A real Python pipeline reads, cleans, validates and calculates the metrics.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
832 source rows: 805 accepted, 58 normalized and 27 rejected with reasons.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Generate a standalone report and an email with the report attached. Preview only.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
September: $54,335.43 net revenue and 289 completed orders. All data is synthetic.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Inspect the source and setup guide on GitHub. The portfolio is hosted on GitHub Pages.
